ions each with type (Buy/Sell), stock, amount, date; Portfolio: \"Your total asset portfolio\" · ₦203,935 · +2%; Presentation: opens over Home; Home stays behind it; Links: close → 04_Home\n6. 06_Notification — Actions: back; Copy: \"Notification\"; Notifications: 3, newest first, each with thumbnail, message, time; Links: back → 04_Home\n7. 07_Profile — Account: avatar · Jonas Macroni · level \"Expert\"; Copy: \"Profile\"; Entries: Bank Account Info · Contact Info · Document Info · Settings · Source of Funding Info; Main navigation: current tab Account; Links: Contact Info → 08_Contact_Info; Bank Account Info → 09_Bank_Account_Info; Home tab → 04_Home\n8. 08_Contact_Info — Account: avatar · edit avatar; Actions: back; Copy: \"Contact info\"; Details: Birthdate · Email · Gender · Name — each with value and Change; Not added yet: Address · Phone Number — each with Add; Links: back → 07_Profile\n9. 09_Bank_Account_Info — Accounts: 2, each with bank logo, bank name, masked number, holder, more options; Actions: Add account · back; Copy: \"Bank account info\"; Links: back → 07_Profile\n\n**Structure (fixed):**\n- Main navigation on 04_Home and 07_Profile — four tabs: Home (Icon_Tab_Home) → 04 · Product (Icon_Tab_Product_Search, entry only) · Transaction (Icon_Tab_Transaction, entry only) · Account (Icon_Tab_Account) → 07. Current tab must match the frame.\n- My Asset opens as overlay above Home. Notifications open from Home. Profile is the Account tab; Contact info and Bank account info pushed with back nav.\n- Entry-only (no screen required): menu, Invest now, See All, See All Plans, Login, Source of Funding Info, Document Info, Settings, Change / Add, edit avatar, more-options, Add account.\n\n**Data & copy (fixed):**\n- User: Jonas Macroni · Expert · 05 November 1993 · Male · jonas.macroni@invest.ai · phone and address not added\n- Portfolio: ₦203,935, +2% — identical on Home and My Asset\n- Plans: Gold 30% return · Silver 60% return · Platinum 90% return. Current plan: Gold\n- History (all Mon 22 Jun 2020): Buy \"AAPL\" Stock ₦200,000 · Sell \"TLKM\" Stock ₦150,000 · Buy \"FB\" Stock ₦1,000,240 · Sell \"AAPL\" Stock ₦1,000,240. Sell = money in, Buy = money out.\n- Articles:\n  - \"Basic type of investments\" — This is how you set your foot for the 2020 stock market recession. What's next…\n  - \"How much can you start with?\" — What do you like to see? It's a very different market from 2018. The way…\n  - \"Welcome to New NASDAQ\" — When we talk about Wall Street, what looks good might be different… (no photo supplied: choose a consistent fallback)\n- Notifications (newest first):\n  - \"Where do you see yourself in the next ages?\" 30 secs ago\n  - \"Check out today's best investor. You'll learn from him.\" 3 min ago\n  - \"Apple stocks just increased. Check it out now.\" 15 min ago\n- Banks: Bank of America — 0182128xxx · Zenith Bank — 0182128xxx; holder Jonas Macroni\n\n**Prototype links:**\n- 01_Splash auto-advances to 02_Welcome\n- 02_Welcome: Create account → 03_Create_Account_Empty\n- 03: back → 02_Welcome; Create account (Filled) → 04_Home\n- 04_Home: portfolio → 05_My_Asset_Overlay; notification entry → 06_Notification; Account tab → 07_Profile\n- 05: close → 04_Home\n- 06: back → 04_Home\n- 07: Contact Info → 08; Bank Account Info → 09; Home tab → 04_Home\n- 08: back → 07\n- 09: back → 07\n\nNow I need to read 01 · Foundations for visual specs. Let me get the metadata for page 1:2.","signature":"a006a64169f04294a386db47"}],"id":"15a84cb1-3c89-4661-8636-0b3b5fdc4ac9","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"613de0ee-9d26-413e-bccb-2a00f6a3efc8","uuid":"33f552ec-ddf1-4f70-a114-97242bcc3fa4","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:21:49.767Z","thinking_duration_ms":16256}
