{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full mobile app design in an assigned Figma file (benchmark task, unattended session). Original user message (Chinese): 请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计： Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/JEkKBZ9RIeFTNfLVV0uQz5/ — 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n   \n   Binding constraints from the system prompt: confirm assigned account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing; use ONLY this assigned file; read 00·Start Here for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements (brief overrides external queries on app name); read 01·Foundations for rules (fonts/colors); reuse 02·Components; reuse 04·Media assets; build everything in 03·Workspace (create if missing; new frames/components/prototype connections allowed even if page starts empty); preserve all reference pages and their existing nodes (never edit/rename/delete them); workflow: whoami → get_metadata → read-only use_figma inspection → use_figma build → get_screenshot verify (multiple screenshots + fixes allowed); load fonts before text editing; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens; finish with assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations; never claim completion for unfinished work. Before EVERY tool call include a concise decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\" in the same assistant message; after each tool result do the same; final response must have \"Reasoning summary: ...\" on first line then \"Final answer:\" and the answer. This is unattended — resolve routine choices using the brief without waiting.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code executes with `figma` global; 50k char limit per call)\n   - Rate limiting on Enterprise Full seat — errors like \"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit\"; retrying the identical call works\n   - No shell/Bash tool available → get_screenshot must use enableBase64Response:true to view images inline\n   - figma.createComponentFromNode(frame) to convert built frames into component masters; figma.combineAsVariants for variant sets\n   - Instance overrides: recursive paint() recolor of fills/strokes on instance children; setCharacters on nested TEXT (requires loadFontAsync first); swapComponent for nested icon swaps; setProperties({'Label#6:0': '...'}) for the provided Button's TEXT property\n   - Image fills: reuse imageHash from reference rects (preserves original bytes); scaleMode 'FIT' for logos/coins/illustration, 'FILL' for photos (articles/notifications)\n   - Prototype interactions via node.reactInterractions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_TAP'}|{type:'AFTER_TIMEOUT',timeout}, action:{type:'NODE',destination,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE'|'MOVE_IN'|'INSTANT'|'SMART_ANIMATE',...}}}]\n   - MUST NOT use: loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync; must use await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)\n   - Fonts: DM Sans (Regular/Medium/Bold), Inter (Regular/Medium/Semi Bold — note space — Bold)\n   - Text truncation: textTruncation='ENDING', maxLines=2; textAutoResize='HEIGHT' + resize(width, h)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file JEkKBZ9RIeFTNfLVV0uQz5** (only file; account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai confirmed, user_id 1692091428764723877)\n   - **Pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), **2002:2 (03·Workspace — target, was empty)**\n   \n   - **Brief (page 0:1, frame 11:2) — the contract**. 11 frames with EXACT names: 01_Splash, 02_Welcome, 03_Create_Account_Empty, 03_Create_Account_Filled, 03_Create_Account_Error, 04_Home, 05_My_Asset_Overlay, 06_Notification, 07_Profile, 08_Contact_Info, 09_Bank_Account_Info. English UI, Nigerian Naira ₦, user Jonas Macroni, viewport 414×932 (Home may scroll).\n     - 01_Splash: Paradise Group logo; auto-advances → 02_Welcome\n     - 02_Welcome: Create account · Login buttons; copy \"Stay on top of your finance with us.\" + \"We are your new financial advisors to recommend the best investments for you.\"; Welcome_Illustration; Create account → 03_Create_Account_Empty\n     - 03 (×3): back · Create account · \"Already have an account?\" Login; copy \"Create an account\" + \"Invest and double your income now\"; Form: Email address · Full name · Password (shown/hidden). Empty = nothing entered, button disabled; Error = email \"jonas.macroni@invest\" + message \"Enter a valid email address\"; Filled = Jonas Macroni · jonas.macroni@invest.ai · masked password, submit enabled. back → 02_Welcome; Create account (Filled) → 04_Home\n     - 04_Home: \"Welcome, Jonas.\" · menu entry · notification entry; Invest now; \"Investment Guide\" + 3 articles (title, summary, thumbnail); bottom nav tab Home active; \"Best Plans\" · See All · Gold 30% / Silver 60% / Platinum 90% return with coin images; \"Your total asset portfolio\" · ₦203,935 · +2%. portfolio → 05; notification → 06; Account tab → 07\n     - 05_My_Asset_Overlay: close · See All Plans; \"My Asset\"; \"Current Plans\" · Gold · 30% return; \"History\" · 4 transactions (type, stock, amount, date); portfolio ₦203,935 +2%; opens over Home, Home stays behind; close → 04_Home\n     - 06_Notification: back; \"Notification\"; 3 notifications newest first (thumbnail, message, time); back → 04_Home\n     - 07_Profile: avatar · Jonas Macroni · \"Expert\"; \"Profile\"; entries Bank Account Info · Contact Info · Document Info · Settings · Source of Funding Info; tab Account active; Contact Info → 08; Bank Account Info → 09; Home tab → 04\n     - 08_Contact_Info: avatar · edit avatar; back; \"Contact info\"; Birthdate/Email/Gender/Name with value + Change; Address/Phone Number \"not added\" + Add; back → 07\n     - 09_Bank_Account_Info: 2 accounts (bank logo, name, masked number, holder, more options); Add account · back; \"Bank account info\"; back → 07\n     - Fixed structure: 4-tab nav on 04 & 07 only: Home (Icon_Tab_Home) · Product (Icon_Tab_Product_Search, entry-only) · Transaction (entry-only) · Account; My Asset = overlay above Home; Notifications from Home; entry-only (no screens): menu, Invest now, See All, See All Plans, Login, Source of Funding Info, Document Info, Settings, Change/Add, edit avatar, more-options, Add account\n     - Fixed data: Jonas Macroni · Expert · 05 November 1993 · Male · jonas.macroni@invest.ai · phone/address not added; Portfolio ₦203,935 +2% (identical Home + My Asset); Plans Gold 30% / Silver 60% / Platinum 90%, current = Gold; History (all Mon 22 Jun 2020): Buy \"AAPL\" ₦200,000 · Sell \"TLKM\" ₦150,000 · Buy \"FB\" ₦1,000,240 · Sell \"AAPL\" ₦1,000,240 (Sell = money in, Buy = money out); Articles: \"Basic type of investments\" — \"This is how you set your foot for the 2020 stock market recession. What's next…\" / \"How much can you start with?\" — \"What do you like to see? It's a very different market from 2018. The way…\" / \"Welcome to New NASDAQ\" — \"When we talk about Wall Street, what looks good might be different…\" (no photo — use consistent fallback); Notifications newest first: \"Where do you see yourself in the next ages?\" 30 secs ago · \"Check out today's best investor. You'll learn from him.\" 3 min ago · \"Apple stocks just increased. Check it out now.\" 15 min ago; Banks: Bank of America — 0182128xxx · Zenith Bank — 0182128xxx, holder Jonas Macroni; follow brief not source (source has typos/mixed currencies)\n     - Evaluation: checklist coverage, data & copy accuracy, flow &