America 5:78 (160×81) acf8cbe59a5e234f12baeddc5f92f00b7d0b13c9; Bank_Logo_Zenith 5:83 (120×96) f2c8a81b61f80454f43321933bced173af5c543f\n     - Icon components: Tab Home 6:269 (19×20), Tab Product Search 6:270 (20×20), Tab Transaction 6:271 (25×25), Tab Account 6:272 (16×20), Menu 6:273 (24×24), Notification 6:274 (19×22), Back 6:275 (8×14, stroke), Chevron 6:276 (16×8, points UP — rotate -90 for right), Close 6:277 (32×32 gray circle + white x), More 6:278 (4×20), Edit 6:279 (24×24), Upvote 6:280 (16×16 green arrow), Contact Info 6:281, Source of Funding 6:282, Bank Account 6:283, Document 6:284, Settings 6:285 (all 24×24)\n   \n   - **CREATED in 03 · Workspace (page 2002:2)** — \"MY COMPONENTS — Paradise Invest UI Kit\" section at x=2500. Master IDs (Call 1): sbLight 2005:3 (white status bar clone, transparent bg), hiLight 2005:14 (white home indicator clone), btnSecondary 2005:18 (354×60 white radius 20 stroke #E2E7E4 1.2, centered \"Label\" Inter Semi Bold 17), btnDisabled 2005:21 (#A2D4B9 fill, white label), inputFilled 2005:24 (stroke #C9D2CC, \"Value\" ink x=24 y=20), inputError 2005:27 (stroke #E5484D 1.5), inputPassword 2005:31 (\"••••••••\" + \"Show\" primary Inter Semi Bold 15 trailing), headerPushed 2005:36 (414×56: back icon 6:275 instance ink x=30 y=21 + \"Title\" DM Sans Bold 20 x=58 y=16), tabHome 2005:56 / tabAccount 2005:76 / tabSet 2005:77 \"Tab Bar\" (414×84 white, 1px divider top, tabs Home/Product/Transaction/Account at centers x=[51.75,155.25,258.75,362.25], icons centered y=28 painted primary(active)/ink3, labels Inter Medium 11 y=44)\n   - Master IDs (Call 2): profileEntry 2006:29 (354×64: 40×40 tint squircle radius 12 + bank icon primary + \"Entry label\" Inter Medium 16 ink x=56 y=22 + chevron 6:276 rotated -90 ink3 at x=316 y=28), articleRow 2006:34 (354×88: 72×72 thumb radius 14 art1 FILL y=8, title Inter Semi Bold 16 x=88 y=6, summary Inter Regular 13.5 ink2 w=266 maxLines 2 x=88 y=32), planCard 2006:39 (110×158 white radius 16 shadow, 56×56 gold coin FIT, \"Gold\" DM Sans Bold 16 centered y=86, \"30% return\" Inter Regular 12 ink2 y=112), txRow 2006:48 (354×64: 40×40 tint circle badge + upvote arrow, title \"Sell “AAPL” Stock\" Inter Semi Bold 15 x=56 y=10, date \"Mon, 22 Jun 2020\" Inter Regular 12.5 ink3 x=56 y=34, amount \"+ ₦1,000,240\" Inter Semi Bold 15 primary right-aligned; nested arrow instance id txArrowId 2006:42 for per-instance recolor/rotation on Buy rows), notifRow 2006:53 (354×72: 48×48 thumb radius 12 notif1 FILL y=10, message Inter Medium 14 w=290 maxLines 2 x=64 y=4, time Inter Regular 12 ink3 x=64 y=46), bankCard 2006:65 (354×116 white radius 20 shadow: 48×48 logo box fill bg radius 12 x=24 y=34 + 36×36 bank1 FIT inside at 6,6, name Inter Semi Bold 16 x=88 y=22, number Inter Regular 14 ink2 x=88 y=48, holder Inter Regular 13 ink3 x=88 y=72, More 6:278 ink3 x=322 y=48), contactRow 2006:70 (354×60: \"Label\" Inter Regular 13 ink3 y=6, \"Value\" Inter Medium 16 ink y=28, \"Change\" Inter Semi Bold 15 primary right y=22)\n   \n   - **Reusable code patterns** (re-paste in each use_figma call since state doesn't persist):\n     ```js\n     const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2002:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     for (const f of [['DM Sans','Regular'],['DM Sans','Medium'],['DM Sans','Bold'],['Inter','Regular'],['Inter','Medium'],['Inter','Semi Bold'],['Inter','Bold']]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:f[0],style:f[1]});\n     const C = { primary:{r:0x31/255,g:0xA0/255,b:0x62/255}, tint:{r:0xE7/255,g:0xF5/255,b:0xEE/255}, ink:{r:0x1B/255,g:0x23/255,b:0x20/255}, ink2:{r:0x5F/255,g:0x6B/255,b:0x64/255}, ink3:{r:0x99/255,g:0xA3/255,b:0x9D/255}, border:{r:0xE2/255,g:0xE7/255,b:0xE4/255}, fieldStroke:{r:0xC9/255,g:0xD2/255,b:0xCC/255}, divider:{r:0xEE/255,g:0xF1/255,b:0xEF/255}, bg:{r:0xF6/255,g:0xF8/255,b:0xF7/255}, white:{r:1,g:1,b:1}, danger:{r:0xE5/255,g:0x48/255,b:0x4D/255}, dis:{r:0xA2/255,g:0xD4/255,b:0xB9/255} };\n     function S(hex,op){const c={color:hex,type:'SOLID'}; if(op!==undefined)c.opacity=op; return [c];}\n     function T(chars,fam,style,size,hex,op){const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:fam,style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size; t.fills=S(hex,op); return t;}\n     function FR(name,w,h){const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.resize(w,h); f.fills=[]; f.clipsContent=false; return f;}\n     function paint(node,hex,op){ if('fills' in node && Array.isArray(node.fills)) node.fills=node.fills.map(f=>f.type==='SOLID'?Object.assign({},f,{color:hex,opacity:(op===undefined?f.opacity:op)}):f); if('strokes' in node && Array.isArray(node.strokes)) node.strokes=node.strokes.map(s=>s.type==='SOLID'?Object.assign({},s,{color:hex,opacity:(op===undefined?s.opacity:op)}):s); if('children' in node) node.children.forEach(c=>paint(c,hex,op)); }\n     function imgRect(hash,w,h,mode,r){const rc=figma.createRectangle(); rc.resize(w,h); rc.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:hash,scaleMode:mode||'FILL'}]; if(r)rc.cornerRadius=r; return rc;}\n     function shadow(node,a,y,r){node.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.07,g:0.16,b:0.11,a:a},offset:{x:0,y:y},radius:r,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];}\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Figma MCP rate limit** (\"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\"): hit ~5 times interleaved with calls. Fix: simply retry the identical call; retries succeed. Expect this pattern to continue — always retry.\n   - **ReferenceError: 'iconIds' is not defined** (Call 1 first retry): I removed the `const iconIds={...}` definition when trimming dead code but left the `for(const k in iconIds)` loop at line 84; script aborted mid-run AFTER creating partial nodes. Fix: since page 2002:2 was empty before the session, ran `page.children.slice().forEach(n=>n.remove())` to clear partial artifacts, then re-ran the full corrected script in one go. Lesson: validate code completeness before submitting; a failed run may leave partial nodes — check/clean.\n   - **get_screenshot returned only a URL** (no Bash tool to curl it). Fix: re-request with `enableBase64Response: true` to get the image inline. Always use this flag.\n   - Dead code artifact in Call 1 first attempt: a `makeTabBar` function containing an unused `const ic=(async()=>{})();` and dead `return` inside forEach — removed in the successful rewrite.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Confirmed account and file access; mapped all 5 pages; extracted full brief, foundations, components, and media catalogs.\n   - Solved image reuse without createImageAsync (unsupported): reuse imageHash strings in new ImagePaints and clone reference rects.\n   - Solved \"dark status bar on green splash\": cloned reference shell components into new light-content masters (transparent bg + white paint) without touching originals.\n   - Chose design system: colors (primary #31A062, tint #E7F5EE, ink #1B2320, ink2 #5F6B64, ink3 #99A39D, border #E2E7E4, fieldStroke #C9D2CC, divider #EEF1EF, bg #F6F8F7, danger #E5484D, disabled #A2D4B9); screen margin 30 → content width 354; DM Sans for display/headings/amounts, Inter for UI text.\n   - Planned screen layout grid on workspace: Row1 y=0: 01_Splash x=0, 02_Welcome x=514, 03_Create_Account_Empty x=1028, 03_Create_Account_Filled x=1542, 03_Create_Account_Error x=2056; Row2 y=1032: 04_Home x=0, 05_My_Asset_Overlay x=514, 06_Notification x=1028, 07_Profile x=1542; Row3 y=2064: 08_Contact_Info x=0, 09_Bank_Account_Info x=514. Components section at x=2500.\n   - Planned 05 overlay: build 04_Home first, clone its content into 05 frame, add black scrim (~40%) + bottom sheet (grabber, \"My Asset\" + close, portfolio row, \"Current Plans\" Gold card, \"History\" 4 transaction rows, \"See All Plans\" button).\n   - Home height budget (~810px content + 84 tab bar + 44 status fits 932): status 44 + header 56 + portfolio card ~150 (green gradient, \"Your total asset portfolio\", ₦203,935 DM Sans Bold 34 white, +2% chip, Invest now white