ft corner moves the shape to negative quadrant. Capture original x,y first.\n\nUpvote arrow 16×16 inside 40×40 badge at (12,12) presumably. For Buy: after rotation=180, set x=orig+16, y=orig+16.\n\nLet me write:\n```js\nconst arr=row.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE')[0];\nif(buy){ arr.rotation=180; arr.x=arr.x+arr.width; arr.y=arr.y+arr.height; recolor(arr,C.danger); }\n```\nWait recolor: arrow is green (#31A062) fill; recolor to danger. arr.fills every SOLID → ok.\n\nHmm — careful: findAll on row instance includes the arrow nested in badge. Good.\n\nAlso for the amount minus sign: use \"− \" (U+2212) or \"-\"? Use \"− ₦200,000\". For Sell \"+ ₦1,000,240\".\n\nTitles: 'Buy \"AAPL\" Stock' etc. Use curly quotes “ ” like master? Master title 'Sell \"AAPL\" Stock' — I built with curly quotes (“AAPL”). Use curly.\n\n06 rows override: message + time texts: findAll TEXT → [message, time].\n\nnotifRow master thumb: image rect FILL. Override hash per row.\n\nLet me also handle 06 row2 avatar: hide rect (visible=false) — instance child visibility override: allowed. Then add cloned avatar frame onto SCREEN at computed position. Row2 at y=218 → thumb global (38, 228). Avatar clone: (await gid('5:27')).clone(); resize(48,48); cornerRadius=12; x=38; y=228. It will be added to page at clone position — must appendChild to screen frame: screen.appendChild(av) after setting x/y (coordinates relative to frame). Note: Avatar_Neutral is on Media page; clone lands on current page; append to frame.\n\n07 profile entries: label override: entry.findAll(TEXT)[0] = 'Entry label'. Icon swap: tint box = frame 'Icon Box' containing bank icon instance. Find: box=entry.findOne(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='Icon Box'); icon=box.findOne(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'); icon.swapComponent(await gid('6:281')) — swapComponent takes component. Components: 6:281 Contact, 6:282 Funding, 6:283 Bank, 6:284 Document, 6:285 Settings.\n\nOrder: Bank Account Info (6:283 default), Contact Info (6:281), Document Info (6:284), Settings (6:285), Source of Funding Info (6:282).\n\nRows y: 308, 384, 460, 536, 612. White fill override + radius 16 + shadow subtle.\n\nAlso entries white bg: inst.fills=S(C.white); inst.cornerRadius=16; shadow(inst,0.06,4,12).\n\nProfile \"Profile\" title y=272.\n\nCheck overlap: entries end 612+64=676; tab bar 846. Fine.\n\nAlright, also I should double-check 06 headerPushed title override: setInstText finds FIRST TEXT in header instance — the back icon instance has no text; Title text is first TEXT. ✓ (used in Call 3 fine).\n\nOne more thing: 05 sheet close icon 6:277 instance — gray circle + white x. On white sheet it reads as gray circle button. Fine.\n\nWrite Call 5 code now. Keep under 50k chars. Return ids.","signature":"82ba089af4df44d2a70769ea"}],"id":"cd328e36-9d3a-40f4-8614-3fe666409a8d","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"613de0ee-9d26-413e-bccb-2a00f6a3efc8","uuid":"57584cdc-7c0a-447b-96c8-ec33ba81d7ef","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:50:09.944Z","thinking_duration_ms":92199}
