{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full mobile app design in an assigned Figma file (benchmark task, unattended session). Original user message (Chinese): 请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计： Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/JEkKBZ9RIeFTNfLVV0uQz5/ — 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n\n   Binding constraints from the system prompt: confirm assigned account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (already confirmed, user_id 1692091428764723877); use ONLY this assigned file; read 00·Start Here for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements (brief overrides external queries on app name); read 01·Foundations for rules (fonts/colors); reuse 02·Components; reuse 04·Media assets; build everything in 03·Workspace (page 2002:2; new frames/components/prototype connections allowed); preserve all reference pages and their existing nodes (never edit/rename/delete them); workflow: whoami → get_metadata → read-only use_figma inspection → use_figma build → get_screenshot verify (multiple screenshots + fixes allowed); load fonts before text editing; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens; finish with assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations; never claim completion for unfinished work. Before EVERY tool call include a concise decision summary prefixed exactly \"Reasoning summary:\" in the same assistant message; final response must have \"Reasoning summary: ...\" on first line then \"Final answer:\" and the answer. Unattended — resolve routine choices via the brief without waiting.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (50k char limit per call; `figma` global; apiVersion \"1.0.0\")\n   - **CRITICAL discovery (most recent tool result): this runtime has NO `reactInterractions` property** — frame/instance prototypes expose `[\"reactions\", \"setReactionsAsync\"]`. Prototype links must be set via the legacy `node.reactions = [...]` property or `await node.setReactionsAsync([...])`. Legacy Reaction shape: `{trigger: {...}, action: {type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition}}` — exact trigger casing ('ON_TAP' vs 'OnTap' / timeout variant) still needs verification on first use\n   - Failed use_figma calls ROLL BACK all changes (no partial nodes survive) — verified empirically\n   - Rate limiting on Enterprise Full seat: \"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit\" → retry identical call (works)\n   - No shell/Bash tool → all screenshots need get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true\n   - Instance override rules learned by error: fills/visibility/text CAN be overridden on instance children; rotation/relativeTransform CANNOT — workaround: hide nested node + add rotated sibling at top level positioned via absoluteBoundingBox deltas\n   - Defensive recolor(): only rewrite fills/strokes when every entry is SOLID, constructing fresh {type:'SOLID',color,opacity} objects, try/catch per node (reference icon components contain some fill lacking `color` that crashes naive paint helpers)\n   - Size-based icon instance lookup inside row instances: `inst.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE').find(n=>Math.round(n.width)===24)`\n   - Image reuse via imageHash in new ImagePaints (createImageAsync forbidden); scaleMode 'FIT' for logos/coins/illustration, 'FILL' for photos/thumbnails\n   - Fonts: DM Sans (Regular/Medium/Bold), Inter (Regular/Medium/Semi Bold — with space — Bold)\n   - Forbidden: loadAllPages