sure we match x-320 within 3: |360-320|=40, excluded. Good.\n\nProfile entries: height≈64? The profileEntry master — was it 64 high? From summary: \"5 white profileEntry instances y=314+i*76\". I don't remember exact height (64). Filter pEntries = INSTANCE with h between 56 and 72. Let me use Math.abs(n.height-64)<6. Then find by inner text.\n\nClose button 2013:259 via gid.\n\nAlright, also I should verify reactions readback at end for splash and portfolio card. Return JSON {errs, splashReactions, pcReactions}.\n\nEdge: setReactionsAsync on rectangle hotspot — supported? Probe said FRAME and INSTANCE have it; rectangles likely too (any node that can have prototype connections). OK.\n\nWrite the call now.","signature":"09fe350c044145338fcd2c7e"}],"id":"d289ee98-026a-4c03-877f-ca147dad9625","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"613de0ee-9d26-413e-bccb-2a00f6a3efc8","uuid":"31922055-7858-49c0-b8bb-2d8682b77e38","timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:00:28.276Z","thinking_duration_ms":64779}
